Vulnérabilité élevée CVE-2026-55604 affectant @arikusi/deepseek-mcp-server (npm) (score CVSS 8.6).

@arikusi/deepseek-mcp-server has an Authorization Bypass Through User-Controlled Key

The process-global SessionStore accepts caller-supplied session_id values without binding them to any authenticated principal or transport session.
